Package: gmdhpmm
Type: Package
Title: Group Method of Data Handling with Polynomial Maximization Method Estimators
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-10-05
Authors@R:
    person("Serhii", "Zabolotnii",
           email = "zabolotniua@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0242-2234"))
Description:
    Implements multilayer Group Method of Data Handling ('GMDH') regression whose
    inner coefficient-estimation step chooses an estimator for each partial model
    inside the self-organizing tournament. The library contains least squares,
    ridge least squares, Huber, least absolute deviations, the Polynomial
    Maximization Method estimators 'PMM2' and 'PMM3' from the 'EstemPMM' package,
    and windowed (weak-moment) 'PMM' estimators that remain stable under heavy
    tails. The estimator is chosen either by a residual-cumulant dispatch with
    bootstrap stabilization on small partitions, or by a validation gate that
    compares the candidates by inner cross-validation (random or blocked folds).
    Also provides reserve-aware external criteria and loaders for open drilling
    datasets.
